<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-widgets – Theme</title><link>https://go-widgets.github.io/docs/0.2/tags/theme/</link><description>Recent content in Theme on go-widgets</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://go-widgets.github.io/docs/0.2/tags/theme/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>The toolkit</title><link>https://go-widgets.github.io/docs/0.2/rendering/toolkit/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-widgets.github.io/docs/0.2/rendering/toolkit/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/go-widgets/toolkit" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;code&gt;go-widgets/toolkit&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the widget
set. Every widget implements the same interface — &lt;code&gt;Bounds&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;SetBounds&lt;/code&gt;,
&lt;code&gt;Draw(p painter.Painter, theme *Theme)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;HitTest&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;OnEvent&lt;/code&gt; — so a host
treats a button, a table and an event calendar alike. Standard library only,
&lt;code&gt;CGO_ENABLED=0&lt;/code&gt;, 100% statement coverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At v0.329.0 it has &lt;strong&gt;160 exported widget types&lt;/strong&gt; in about &lt;strong&gt;69,000 lines&lt;/strong&gt; of
widget code. Those two numbers are measured at that tag, not carried over: the
toolkit&amp;rsquo;s README gives the commands, and they should be run again rather than
the figures repeated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="the-families"&gt;The families&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="the-families"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#the-families" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Family&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Widgets&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Action&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Button&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ToggleButton&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;CheckButton&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;RadioButton&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;RadioGroup&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Switch&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;SplitButton&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;IconButton&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;CycleButton&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Chip&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;SegmentedBar&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Input&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Entry&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;TextView&lt;/code&gt; (selection, IME preview, syntax spans, line numbers), &lt;code&gt;SpinButton&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Scale&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;RangeSlider&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;SearchEntry&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;TagField&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ComboBox&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;FormField&lt;/code&gt; with &lt;code&gt;Validate&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;Rule&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Selection&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;ListBox&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;TreeView&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;DropDown&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Containers&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Container&lt;/code&gt; with a swappable &lt;code&gt;Layout&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;FitLayout&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;BoxLayout&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;BorderLayout&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;CardLayout&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;FlowLayout&lt;/code&gt;); &lt;code&gt;HBox&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;VBox&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Grid&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Frame&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Dock&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Border&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Stack&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Overlay&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Paned&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Splitter&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Expander&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Accordion&lt;/code&gt;; a declarative &lt;code&gt;Node&lt;/code&gt; builder&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Navigation&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Menu&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;MenuBar&lt;/code&gt; (with &lt;code&gt;Alt&lt;/code&gt;+letter), &lt;code&gt;ContextMenu&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Popover&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;CommandPalette&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Dialog&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;MessageDialog&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Wizard&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Notebook&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ViewSwitcher&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Carousel&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Feedback&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;ProgressBar&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ProgressCircle&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;LevelBar&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Spinner&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Tooltip&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Notification&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Toast&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Banner&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Alert&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Badge&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Skeleton&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Data&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Table&lt;/code&gt; (cell editing, frozen columns, group rows, aggregates, row expanders), &lt;code&gt;TreeTable&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;PropertyGrid&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Kanban&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Gantt&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Agenda&lt;/code&gt; (week, month, quarter, year; several calendars)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Charts&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;LineChart&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;BarChart&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;PieChart&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;AreaChart&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ScatterChart&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;RadarChart&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Gauge&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Sparkline&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Composite&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;FileChooser&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ColorChooser&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ColorPicker&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;FontChooser&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Calendar&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;DatePicker&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;DateRangePicker&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;TimePicker&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;MarkdownView&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;MarkdownEditor&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;TerminalView&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Shell&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Window&lt;/code&gt; with client-side decorations, &lt;code&gt;HeaderBar&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Toolbar&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Ribbon&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Statusbar&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;StatusIcon&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;StatusArea&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Wallpaper&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Thumbnail&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every one of them, live: the &lt;a href="https://go-widgets.github.io/gallery/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;gallery&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="ribbon"&gt;Ribbon&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="ribbon"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#ribbon" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ribbon&lt;/code&gt; is an Office-style command ribbon: tabs of labelled groups holding
large buttons (icon above the text), small ones (icon beside it), toggles, split
buttons, drop-downs and a small gallery. It follows the Windows ribbon
guidelines: as the window narrows each group steps down by priority — full,
compact, icons only, then one pop-up button — so the ribbon shows the largest
combination that fits; it collapses to its tabs (Ctrl+F1, or the chevron) and a
tab then peeks at its body; Alt shows keytips; tooltips carry the shortcut and a
description. Tab and toolbar navigation follow the WAI-ARIA patterns, and its
boundaries and focus ring keep 3:1 contrast in light and dark themes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every control is a view on an &lt;code&gt;Action&lt;/code&gt; — the one command a menu, a palette and
the ribbon share — and &lt;code&gt;NewCommandAction&lt;/code&gt; makes one from a view-model
&lt;code&gt;mvvm.Command&lt;/code&gt;, so its &lt;code&gt;CanExecute&lt;/code&gt; greys the control. The active tab, the
collapsed state, a toggle and a drop-down&amp;rsquo;s choice are &lt;code&gt;mvvm.Observable&lt;/code&gt;s. Put
the ribbon under a &lt;code&gt;PopoverHost&lt;/code&gt; and its menus draw over the page with no host
code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;RibbonGrid&lt;/code&gt; is a control kind whose pop-up is a &lt;code&gt;GridCols&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;code&gt;GridRows&lt;/code&gt; grid of
cells (8 by 6 when zero, at most 16 by 16), as the Table button of a word
processor has. The pointer or the arrow keys light the cells from the corner up
to the one under them and a caption says &amp;ldquo;3 × 2&amp;rdquo;; a click or Enter chooses and
calls &lt;code&gt;OnGrid(cols, rows)&lt;/code&gt;; Home and End jump, Escape closes. It is drawn in
light and dark and reported to assistive technology as a button that is
expanded while the grid is open.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;toolkit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;RibbonControl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Kind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;toolkit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;RibbonGrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Label&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;Table&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;GridCols&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;GridRows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;OnGrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;insertTable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="splitter"&gt;Splitter&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="splitter"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#splitter" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Splitter&lt;/code&gt; lays N panes side by side (or one above the other, with
&lt;code&gt;vertical&lt;/code&gt; true) and puts a draggable, focusable divider between each
neighbouring pair, after the WAI-ARIA window-splitter pattern. A pane is
either &lt;strong&gt;fixed&lt;/strong&gt; — its &lt;code&gt;Size&lt;/code&gt;, in logical pixels, is an &lt;code&gt;mvvm.Observable[int]&lt;/code&gt;
the divider writes — or &lt;strong&gt;flexible&lt;/strong&gt;, sharing what the fixed panes leave by its
&lt;code&gt;Weight&lt;/code&gt;, also an &lt;code&gt;Observable&lt;/code&gt;. Each pane has a &lt;code&gt;Min&lt;/code&gt; and a &lt;code&gt;Max&lt;/code&gt;. A
&lt;code&gt;Collapsible&lt;/code&gt; fixed pane closes (size 0) when the divider is pulled below half
its &lt;code&gt;Min&lt;/code&gt;, or on a double-click or Enter, and opens again the same way. A pane&amp;rsquo;s
&lt;code&gt;Visible&lt;/code&gt; observable switches it and its divider off. Because the sizes live in
observables, a view-model can bind, persist and restore them; &lt;code&gt;OnResized&lt;/code&gt; is
called once per finished gesture with the panes the person changed, never for a
layout that merely followed a window resize.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;files&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;mvvm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;NewObservable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;240&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// fixed pane, logical px&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;w&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;mvvm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;NewObservable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// flexible pane, weight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;toolkit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;NewSplitter&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;toolkit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;SplitPane&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Widget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;tree&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;Files&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Size&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;files&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Min&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;120&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Max&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;480&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Collapsible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;toolkit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;SplitPane&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Widget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;editor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;Editor&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Weight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;w&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Min&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;OnResized&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;changed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kt"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;save&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;files&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Get&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;w&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Get&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;())&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A divider takes the focus: the arrow keys (Up and Down when vertical) move it
by &lt;code&gt;Step&lt;/code&gt; logical pixels, four times that with Shift; Home and End take the pane
before it to its smallest and largest; Enter collapses or restores the fixed
pane it controls; Tab moves between dividers. Each divider is a
&lt;code&gt;RoleSeparator&lt;/code&gt; with &lt;code&gt;aria-valuemin&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;aria-valuemax&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;aria-valuenow&lt;/code&gt;, named
&amp;ldquo;Resize&amp;rdquo; and the pane&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;Name&lt;/code&gt;. &lt;code&gt;Cursor(x, y)&lt;/code&gt; returns &lt;code&gt;&amp;quot;col-resize&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt; or
&lt;code&gt;&amp;quot;row-resize&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt; over a divider, and &lt;code&gt;SplitterColors(theme)&lt;/code&gt; gives the divider
line and accent, which keep 3:1 contrast against the background and surface in
both default themes, as the focus ring does.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="themes"&gt;Themes&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="themes"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#themes" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;One &lt;code&gt;Theme&lt;/code&gt; value cascades through the whole tree: change a colour at the
root and every widget repaints with it. &lt;code&gt;DefaultLight()&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;DefaultDark()&lt;/code&gt;
are built in, and &lt;code&gt;LoadGTKTheme(css)&lt;/code&gt; reads the &lt;code&gt;@define-color&lt;/code&gt; block of any
GTK 3 or libadwaita theme — Adwaita, WhiteSur, Solarized — into a &lt;code&gt;Theme&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="text"&gt;Text&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="text"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#text" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compiled-in default is a 5×7 bitmap font, so pixel tests keep their
geometry. One call switches the whole UI to anti-aliased, shaped text:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;toolkit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;UseOpenTypeText&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Atkinson Hyperlegible, bundled; js/wasm-safe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The face comes from &lt;a href="https://github.com/go-opentype/fonts" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;go-opentype/fonts&lt;/a&gt;
and is rasterised by &lt;a href="https://github.com/go-opentype/opentype" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;go-opentype&lt;/a&gt;,
in Go, with no C font library and no system font lookup.
&lt;code&gt;NewTrueTypeFont(ttf, px)&lt;/code&gt; loads another face; &lt;code&gt;NewFallbackFont&lt;/code&gt; chains
several, for example to add a CJK or Arabic face; a widget&amp;rsquo;s own &lt;code&gt;Font&lt;/code&gt; field
overrides the global one for that widget alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="input"&gt;Input&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="input"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#input" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mouse, keyboard, IME composition, touch (&lt;code&gt;EventTouchStart&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;Move&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;End&lt;/code&gt;, with
&lt;code&gt;GestureRecognizer&lt;/code&gt; for taps, long presses and swipes), drag and drop
(&lt;code&gt;DragSource&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;DropTarget&lt;/code&gt;). Multi-row selection in &lt;code&gt;ListBox&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Table&lt;/code&gt; and
&lt;code&gt;TreeView&lt;/code&gt; works from the mouse and from the keyboard, and honours ⌘ as well
as Ctrl, because on macOS Ctrl-click is the secondary click.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="accessibility"&gt;Accessibility&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="accessibility"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#accessibility" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A toolkit that paints its own pixels gives a screen reader nothing to read
unless it says what it drew. Widgets implement &lt;code&gt;Accessible&lt;/code&gt; — a role, a name,
a value — and &lt;code&gt;CollectA11y&lt;/code&gt; gathers them for the host to publish: AT-SPI on
Linux through &lt;a href="https://go-widgets.github.io/docs/0.2/surfaces/native-window/"&gt;&lt;code&gt;window&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and a
virtual view hierarchy on &lt;a href="https://go-widgets.github.io/docs/0.2/surfaces/android/#accessibility"&gt;Android&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Skins: a widget's parts and states as data</title><link>https://go-widgets.github.io/docs/0.2/rendering/skin/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-widgets.github.io/docs/0.2/rendering/skin/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;The toolkit&amp;rsquo;s widgets are written in Go: a &lt;code&gt;Button&lt;/code&gt;&amp;rsquo;s parts, its hover,
pressed and disabled faces and its click feedback all live in &lt;code&gt;button.go&lt;/code&gt;.
That is fast and exact, and every visual change is a code change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/go-widgets/skin" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;code&gt;go-widgets/skin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; moves that description
into data — the idea of Enlightenment&amp;rsquo;s Edje. A &lt;code&gt;.skin.json&lt;/code&gt; document names a
widget&amp;rsquo;s &lt;strong&gt;parts&lt;/strong&gt;, their look in each &lt;strong&gt;state&lt;/strong&gt;, and the &lt;strong&gt;programs&lt;/strong&gt; that
move them between states when a signal arrives. Re-skinning, or building a new
control, then needs no recompilation: the program loads different bytes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;theme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;skin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Load&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;jsonBytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// parse and validate every collection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;obj&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;_&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;theme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;New&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;button&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;obj&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Bind&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;skin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;NewMVVMContext&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;().&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Set&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;$.label&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;labelObs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;obj&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;SetBounds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;toolkit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;Rect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;W&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;96&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;H&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;28&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// each frame&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;obj&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;OnEvent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;ev&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// pointer events become signals, signals states&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;busy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;obj&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Tick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;())&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// advance the transitions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;obj&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Draw&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;theme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;Palette&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;())&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A &lt;code&gt;skin.Object&lt;/code&gt; is a &lt;code&gt;toolkit.Widget&lt;/code&gt;, so it sits in a &lt;code&gt;VBox&lt;/code&gt; next to
hand-written widgets. The layouts place widgets; a skin arranges what is
inside one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="the-format"&gt;The format&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="the-format"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#the-format" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-jsonc" data-lang="jsonc"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;collections&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;#34;button&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
